<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px',
    height: '720px',
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '60px 80px',
    display: 'flex',
    flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
    <Box style={{
        display: 'flex',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        gap: 6,
        marginBottom: 36,
    }}>
        <Text style={{
            fontSize: 14,
            color: '#C8102E',
            fontWeight: 'bold',
        }}>
            01 RSI 是什么
        </Text>
        <Text style={{
            fontSize: 36,
            color: '#1A1A1A',
            fontWeight: 'bold',
        }}>
            定义与误称澄清
        </Text>
        <Box style={{
            width: '100%',
            height: 2,
            background: '#C8102E',
            marginTop: 4,
        }} />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{
        display: 'flex',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        gap: 24,
        flex: 1,
    }}>
        <Box style={{
            display: 'flex',
            flexDirection: 'row',
            gap: 32,
        }}>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                border: '2px solid #C8102E',
                borderRadius: 8,
                padding: 24,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 12,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                    RSI（严格定义）
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    AI <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C8102E' }}>完全自主</span>地重写自身权重
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    人类不参与 · 仍是推测性的未来场景
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                border: '2px solid #E5E5E5',
                borderRadius: 8,
                padding: 24,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 12,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#333333', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                    RSI-adjacent
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    AI 在<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C8102E' }}>人类监督</span>下参与后继系统开发
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    在环中监督 · 2025–2026 年已成为生产现象
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
            background: '#F8F8F8',
            borderLeft: '4px solid #C8102E',
            borderRadius: 4,
            padding: 20,
            display: 'flex',
            flexDirection: 'column',
            gap: 10,
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                CSA 2026 报告核心论断
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                "完全自主的 RSI 仍然是推测性的。但部分、受监督且工具化的 RSI 已经在进行中，而支撑这些受监督循环的基础设施恰恰构成了<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C8102E' }}>新的攻击面</span>。"
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
            display: 'flex',
            flexDirection: 'row',
            gap: 24,
        }}>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'row',
                gap: 12,
                alignItems: 'flex-start',
            }}>
                <FAIcon name='exclamation-circle' style={{ fill: '#C8102E', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 4 }}>
                        误读一：科幻无关论
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        "RSI 是科幻，与我们无关"——忽略了 RSI-adjacent 已在改变 AI 开发供应链
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'row',
                gap: 12,
                alignItems: 'flex-start',
            }}>
                <FAIcon name='exclamation-circle' style={{ fill: '#C8102E', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 4 }}>
                        误读二：失控恐慌论
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        "RSI 已经失控了"——把受监督的工程实践误判为自主智能爆炸
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
